# D3-FO-004: A watercolour and an acrylic paint can carry blue colour differently
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL
add v1 watercolour_blue 0.5g
add v2 water 30mL
add v2 acrylic_blue 0.5g
stir v1 300rpm 20s
stir v2 300rpm 20s
look v1
look v2
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
add v1 water 30mL
add v2 water 30mL
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
